<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>La Arquitectura de la Conducta Punible · Arts. 9–12 CP Colombiano</title>
<style>
/* ============================================================
   SISTEMA DE DISEÑO
   ============================================================ */
:root{
  --bg:#f7f5ef;
  --paper:#ffffff;
  --ink:#22303f;
  --muted:#5b6675;
  --dogma:#9b2c2c;
  --onto:#2c5282;
  --herm:#276749;
  --gold:#975a16;
  --line:#e3e0d6;
  --shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(30,40,60,.06);
  --shadow-hover:0 14px 34px rgba(30,40,60,.10);
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
  font-family:'Segoe UI',system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;
  background:var(--bg);
  color:var(--ink);
  line-height:1.75;
}
h1,h2,h3,h4,.serif{font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif}
a{color:inherit}
::selection{background:#9b2c2c;color:#fff}

/* Progreso de lectura */
#progress{
  position:fixed;top:0;left:0;height:3px;width:0%;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--dogma),var(--onto),var(--herm));
  z-index:1000;transition:width .1s linear;
}

/* ============================================================
   PORTADA
   ============================================================ */
header{
  background:
    repeating-linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,.025) 0 2px,transparent 2px 22px),
    linear-gradient(135deg,#16202c 0%,#2b3a4d 100%);
  color:#fff;padding:5rem 2rem 4rem;text-align:center;
  border-bottom:5px solid var(--dogma);
}
.eyebrow{
  font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.32em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:#c9b98a;margin-bottom:1.4rem;font-weight:600;
}
header h1{
  font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.4rem);line-height:1.2;
  font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.5px;margin-bottom:1.2rem;
}
header h1 em{font-style:italic;color:#e6d9b8}
header p{
  max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;font-size:1.05rem;
  color:#c3cbd6;font-style:italic;
}
.header-meta{
  margin-top:2rem;display:inline-flex;gap:1.6rem;flex-wrap:wrap;
  justify-content:center;font-size:.78rem;letter-spacing:.12em;
  text-transform:uppercase;color:#93a1b3;
}
.header-meta span{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem}
.header-meta b{color:#e6d9b8;font-weight:600}

/* ============================================================
   MÉTODO
   ============================================================ */
.method{
  max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:3.5rem 2rem 1rem;
}
.section-kicker{
  font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--muted);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:.6rem;
}
.method h2{font-size:1.9rem;margin-bottom:1.6rem;font-weight:400}
.method-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:1.4rem}
.method-card{
  background:var(--paper);padding:1.6rem;border-radius:10px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);border-left:4px solid var(--line);
}
.method-card.d{border-color:var(--dogma)}
.method-card.o{border-color:var(--onto)}
.method-card.h{border-color:var(--herm)}
.method-card h3{font-size:1.15rem;margin-bottom:.4rem}
.method-card.d h3{color:var(--dogma)}
.method-card.o h3{color:var(--onto)}
.method-card.h h3{color:var(--herm)}
.method-card .subtitle{
  font-size:.72rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.16em;
  color:var(--muted);display:block;margin-bottom:.8rem;
}
.method-card p{font-size:.92rem;color:var(--muted)}

/* ============================================================
   NAVEGACIÓN
   ============================================================ */
nav{
  position:sticky;top:0;z-index:200;background:var(--paper);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,.04);
}
.nav-inner{
  max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;overflow-x:auto;
  padding:0 1rem;scrollbar-width:thin;
}
nav a{
  text-decoration:none;padding:1.05rem 1.15rem;font-size:.85rem;
  font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;border-bottom:3px solid transparent;
  transition:.25s;color:var(--muted);
}
nav a:hover{color:var(--dogma);background:#faf6f6}
nav a.active{color:var(--dogma);border-color:var(--dogma)}
nav a.tool{color:var(--gold)}
nav a.tool.active{border-color:var(--gold)}

/* ============================================================
   MAPA / PIPELINE
   ============================================================ */
main{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 2rem}
.mapa{padding:3.5rem 0 1rem}
.pipeline{
  display:flex;align-items:stretch;gap:.7rem;flex-wrap:wrap;
  margin-top:1.4rem;
}
.pipe-node{
  flex:1;min-width:190px;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:10px;padding:1.2rem;text-decoration:none;
  transition:.25s;position:relative;display:block;
}
.pipe-node:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-hover);border-color:#c9b98a}
.pipe-node .num{
  font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:1.6rem;color:#c9b98a;display:block;line-height:1;
}
.pipe-node strong{display:block;font-size:1rem;margin:.5rem 0 .3rem}
.pipe-node small{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);display:block}
.pipe-arrow{align-self:center;color:#b9b3a3;font-size:1.3rem}

/* ============================================================
   ARTÍCULOS
   ============================================================ */
.article-section{padding:4.5rem 0 1rem;scroll-margin-top:75px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.article-section:first-of-type{border-top:none}
.article-header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1.4rem;margin-bottom:1.6rem}
.roman{
  font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:bold;
  color:var(--dogma);background:#f1e6e2;border:1px solid #e4cfc9;
  width:72px;height:72px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  border-radius:8px;flex-shrink:0;
}
.article-header h2{font-size:2rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.25}
.article-header .tagline{
  display:block;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;font-size:.9rem;
  color:var(--muted);font-style:italic;margin-top:.4rem;font-weight:400;
}
.legal-text{
  background:var(--paper);border-left:5px solid var(--dogma);
  padding:1.6rem 1.9rem;margin-bottom:1.2rem;border-radius:0 10px 10px 0;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);font-family:Georgia,serif;
  font-size:1.02rem;color:#3d4756;
}
.legal-text p+p{margin-top:.9rem}
.legal-label{
  display:block;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;font-size:.65rem;
  letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);
  margin-bottom:.8rem;font-weight:700;
}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:2rem}
.chip{
  font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.04em;padding:.3rem .8rem;
  background:#eceae2;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:30px;color:#5c6470;
}

.perspectives-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(290px,1fr));gap:1.5rem}
.perspective-card{
  background:var(--paper);border-radius:12px;padding:1.8rem;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);border-top:4px solid transparent;
  transition:transform .3s,box-shadow .3s;display:flex;flex-direction:column;
}
.perspective-card:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-hover)}
.perspective-card.dogma{border-top-color:var(--dogma)}
.perspective-card.onto{border-top-color:var(--onto)}
.perspective-card.herm{border-top-color:var(--herm)}
.card-header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.7rem;margin-bottom:.3rem}
.card-icon{font-size:1.35rem}
.card-title{font-size:.95rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em}
.dogma .card-title{color:var(--dogma)}
.onto .card-title{color:var(--onto)}
.herm .card-title{color:var(--herm)}
.card-sub{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted);font-style:italic;margin-bottom:1.2rem;letter-spacing:.02em}
.card-content p{font-size:.92rem;color:#4a5563;margin-bottom:1rem;text-align:justify}
.card-content p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
.card-content strong{color:var(--ink);font-weight:650}
.card-content em{color:#39434f}

.callout{
  margin-top:1.6rem;background:#fbf6ea;border:1px solid #ecdfbf;
  border-left:4px solid var(--gold);border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;
  padding:1.2rem 1.5rem;
}
.callout .label{
  font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--gold);font-weight:700;display:block;margin-bottom:.5rem;
}
.callout p{font-size:.9rem;color:#6b5b3a}

.case-study{
  margin-top:1.2rem;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;
}
.case-study summary{
  cursor:pointer;padding:1.1rem 1.5rem;font-weight:600;font-size:.92rem;
  list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.7rem;transition:.2s;
}
.case-study summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.case-study summary:hover{background:#faf9f5}
.case-study summary .marker{
  width:22px;height:22px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:50%;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:.8rem;
  color:var(--dogma);flex-shrink:0;transition:.3s;
}
.case-study[open] summary .marker{transform:rotate(45deg);background:var(--dogma);color:#fff;border-color:var(--dogma)}
.case-study .case-body{padding:0 1.5rem 1.4rem;font-size:.92rem;color:var(--muted)}
.case-study .case-body p+p{margin-top:.7rem}

/* ============================================================
   TALLER / SIMULADOR
   ============================================================ */
.taller{padding:4.5rem 0 2rem;scroll-margin-top:75px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.taller h2{font-size:2.1rem;font-weight:400;margin-bottom:.6rem}
.taller .intro{color:var(--muted);max-width:780px;margin-bottom:2rem;font-size:.98rem}
.simulator{
  background:var(--paper);border-radius:16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  padding:2rem;border:1px solid var(--line);
}
.sim-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:1.4rem}
.sim-top h3{font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:600;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif}
.sim-top .hint{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}
.case-tabs{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.6rem;margin-bottom:1.8rem}
.case-tab{
  border:1px solid var(--line);background:#faf9f6;color:var(--muted);
  padding:.6rem 1rem;border-radius:30px;cursor:pointer;font-size:.82rem;
  font-weight:600;transition:.25s;font-family:inherit;
}
.case-tab:hover{border-color:#c9b98a;color:var(--ink)}
.case-tab[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;border-color:var(--ink)}
.case-facts{
  background:#f4f2ec;border-radius:10px;padding:1.3rem 1.5rem;margin-bottom:1.8rem;
  border-left:3px solid #c9b98a;
}
.case-facts .label{
  font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--gold);font-weight:700;display:block;margin-bottom:.5rem;
}
.case-facts p{font-size:.95rem;color:#4a5563}

.gates{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.9rem}
.gate{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:44px 1fr;gap:1rem;
  border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:4px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:8px;padding:1.1rem 1.3rem;background:#fff;
  transition:box-shadow .25s;
}
.gate:hover{box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.gate.pass{border-left-color:var(--herm)}
.gate.fail{border-left-color:var(--dogma)}
.gate.partial{border-left-color:var(--gold)}
.gate.stop{border-left-color:#a0aec0;background:#fafaf8}
.gate-index{
  font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:1.35rem;color:#b9b3a3;
  line-height:1;padding-top:.15rem;
}
.gate-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:.8rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:.5rem}
.gate-top h4{font-size:1.02rem;font-weight:600;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif}
.pill{
  font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;
  font-weight:700;padding:.22rem .65rem;border-radius:20px;white-space:nowrap;
}
.pill.pass{background:#e6f2ea;color:var(--herm)}
.pill.fail{background:#fae8e8;color:var(--dogma)}
.pill.partial{background:#fbf0d9;color:var(--gold)}
.pill.stop{background:#e9edf1;color:#64748b}
.gate p{font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted)}
.gate-norma{
  display:inline-block;margin-top:.6rem;font-size:.7rem;
  color:#8a929e;letter-spacing:.06em;
}
.verdict{
  margin-top:1.6rem;background:#22303f;color:#e6eaf0;
  border-radius:10px;padding:1.5rem 1.7rem;border-left:5px solid #c9b98a;
}
.verdict .label{
  font-size:.65rem;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:#c9b98a;font-weight:700;display:block;margin-bottom:.6rem;
}
.verdict p{font-size:.98rem}
.contrast{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:1rem;margin-top:1.2rem}
.contrast-box{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:1.1rem 1.3rem;background:#fbfaf7}
.contrast-box h5{
  font-size:.68rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;
  margin-bottom:.5rem;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;font-weight:700;
}
.contrast-box.old h5{color:var(--dogma)}
.contrast-box.new h5{color:var(--herm)}
.contrast-box p{font-size:.86rem;color:var(--muted)}
.gates.animate{animation:fadeUp .45s ease}
@keyframes fadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}

/* ============================================================
   SÍNTESIS / GLOSARIO / REFERENCIAS
   ============================================================ */
.sintesis{padding:4.5rem 0 2rem;scroll-margin-top:75px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.sintesis h2{font-size:2.1rem;font-weight:400;margin-bottom:.8rem}
.sintesis .intro{color:var(--muted);max-width:820px;margin-bottom:2rem}
.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);background:var(--paper)}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:820px;font-size:.86rem}
thead{background:#22303f;color:#fff}
th{padding:1rem;text-align:left;font-weight:600;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}
th:nth-child(3){color:#f0b9b9}
th:nth-child(4){color:#a9c6e8}
th:nth-child(5){color:#a3d4b6}
td{padding:1.1rem 1rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top;color:var(--muted)}
td:first-child{font-weight:700;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap}
td:nth-child(2){color:var(--ink);font-style:italic}
tbody tr:hover{background:#faf9f5}
.closing{
  margin-top:2rem;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:12px;padding:2rem;text-align:center;
}
.closing .serif{font-size:1.5rem;font-style:italic;color:var(--dogma);margin-bottom:.8rem}
.closing p{color:var(--muted);max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;font-size:.95rem}

.glosario{padding:3rem 0 1rem;scroll-margin-top:75px}
.glosario details{
  background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;
  padding:0 1.6rem;box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}
.glosario summary{
  cursor:pointer;padding:1.4rem 0;font-family:Georgia,serif;
  font-size:1.3rem;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
}
.glosario summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.glosario summary span{font-size:1.4rem;color:var(--dogma);transition:.3s}
.glosario details[open] summary span{transform:rotate(45deg)}
.gloss-list{padding-bottom:1.6rem;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:1.4rem}
.gloss-list dt{font-weight:700;font-size:.92rem;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:.3rem}
.gloss-list dd{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted)}

.refs{padding:3rem 0 4rem}
.refs h3{font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:400;margin-bottom:1.4rem}
.ref-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:1rem}
.ref{
  background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;
  padding:1.1rem 1.3rem;font-size:.87rem;color:var(--muted);
}
.ref b{color:var(--ink);display:block;margin-bottom:.25rem;font-weight:650}
.ref i{color:#7a8391}

footer{
  background:#16202c;color:#8b98a9;text-align:center;padding:3rem 2rem;
}
footer strong{color:#d8dde5;display:block;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:.6rem;font-weight:400}
footer p{font-size:.82rem;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto .5rem}
footer .fine{font-size:.72rem;opacity:.65;margin-top:1.2rem}

/* Revelado */
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);transition:opacity .7s ease,transform .7s ease}
.reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none}

/* ============================================================
   RESPONSIVE / IMPRESIÓN
   ============================================================ */
@media(max-width:900px){
  .perspectives-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .article-header{gap:1rem}
  .article-header h2{font-size:1.6rem}
  .roman{width:58px;height:58px;font-size:1.2rem}
  .pipe-arrow{display:none}
  header{padding:3.5rem 1.5rem}
}
@media(max-width:600px){
  main{padding:0 1.1rem}
  .method{padding:2.5rem 1.1rem 1rem}
  .simulator{padding:1.2rem}
  .gate{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.4rem}
  .gate-index{display:none}
  .legal-text{padding:1.2rem}
  .card-content p{text-align:left}
  .contrast{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}
@media print{
  nav,#progress,.case-tabs,.sim-top .hint{display:none}
  body{background:#fff;color:#000}
  header{background:#fff;color:#000;border-bottom:2px solid #000;padding:2rem 0}
  header p,header h1 em,.eyebrow,.header-meta{color:#000}
  .perspective-card,.legal-text,.simulator{box-shadow:none;break-inside:avoid}
  .article-section{break-before:page}
  .reveal{opacity:1!important;transform:none!important}
  .case-study{break-inside:avoid}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="progress"></div>

<header>
  <div class="eyebrow">Libro Primero · Parte General · Continuidad del análisis</div>
  <h1>La arquitectura de la<br><em>conducta punible</em></h1>
  <p>Una lectura tridimensional de los artículos 9 a 12 del Código Penal colombiano:
     de la causalidad a la imputación, del tipo al injusto, del injusto al reproche.</p>
  <div class="header-meta">
    <span><b>Ley 599 de 2000</b></span>
    <span>Artículos <b>9 — 12</b></span>
    <span>Dogmática · Ontología · Hermenéutica</span>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ================= MÉTODO ================= -->
<section class="method">
  <div class="section-kicker">La clave de lectura</div>
  <h2>Tres preguntas frente a cada norma</h2>
  <div class="method-grid">
    <div class="method-card d">
      <h3>Dogmática</h3>
      <span class="subtitle">La estructura · ¿Qué significa?</span>
      <p>La ciencia del derecho positivo. Reconstruye los conceptos, la sistema-
         tización y las consecuencias jurídicas de la norma: sus elementos, sus
         límites y su lugar en la teoría del delito.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="method-card o">
      <h3>Ontología</h3>
      <span class="subtitle">El fundamento · ¿Qué es?</span>
      <p>La pregunta por el ser de lo que la norma nombra. ¿Qué realidad tiene
         un “tipo”, un “bien jurídico”, una “omisión”, una “culpa”? Aquí el
         derecho dialoga con la metafísica y la filosofía de la persona.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="method-card h">
      <h3>Hermenéutica</h3>
      <span class="subtitle">El sentido · ¿Cómo se aplica?</span>
      <p>La teoría de la interpretación y de la aplicación. Qué métodos legitiman
         un sentido del texto, cómo se resuelven sus tensiones y cómo se
         traduce la norma en una decisión judicial concreta.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<nav>
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a href="#art9">Art. 9 · Conducta</a>
    <a href="#art10">Art. 10 · Tipicidad</a>
    <a href="#art11">Art. 11 · Antijuridicidad</a>
    <a href="#art12">Art. 12 · Culpabilidad</a>
    <a href="#taller" class="tool">⚗ Taller de imputación</a>
    <a href="#sintesis">Síntesis</a>
    <a href="#glosario">Glosario</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<main>

<!-- ================= MAPA ================= -->
<section class="mapa">
  <div class="section-kicker">Recorrido del análisis</div>
  <h2 class="serif" style="font-size:1.7rem;font-weight:400">Cuatro filtros. Un solo poder limitado.</h2>
  <div class="pipeline">
    <a href="#art9" class="pipe-node">
      <span class="num">IX</span>
      <strong>Conducta punible</strong>
      <small>¿Puede atribuírsele el hecho?<br>Imputación, no mera causalidad.</small>
    </a>
    <span class="pipe-arrow">→</span>
    <a href="#art10" class="pipe-node">
      <span class="num">X</span>
      <strong>Tipicidad</strong>
      <small>¿Está descrito en la ley?<br>El molde legal de lo prohibido.</small>
    </a>
